---

<section id="gridsaas" class="py-24 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">
      <span class="gradient-text">The Vision: Grid-SaaS</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl">
      From data center optimization to energy utility intelligence.
    </p>

    <!-- Pivot flow -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center mb-16">
      <div class="gradient-border rounded-2xl p-8">
        <div class="text-sm text-indigo-400 font-semibold mb-2">Phase 1 — B2B</div>
        <h3 class="text-white text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Data Center Optimization</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400">Data centers reduce their energy costs by 15–30% through intelligent predictive scaling.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gradient-border rounded-2xl p-8 border-indigo-500/50 bg-indigo-500/5">
        <div class="text-sm text-indigo-400 font-semibold mb-2">Phase 2 — B2B2B</div>
        <h3 class="text-white text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Grid-SaaS for Energy Utilities</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400">Energy utilities predict data center load to manage grid congestion caused by the AI boom.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Quote -->
    <blockquote class="gradient-border-l border-l-4 border-indigo-500 rounded-r-xl p-8 mb-12">
      <p class="text-slate-300 italic text-lg leading-relaxed">
        "Our customer is no longer just the data center trying to save power.
        Our customer is the energy utility provider. We sell them predictive load forecasting
        to manage grid congestion caused by the AI boom."
      </p>
    </blockquote>

    <!-- Benefits -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <span class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm border border-indigo-500/30 bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-300">Demand Response</span>
      <span class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm border border-indigo-500/30 bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-300">Day-Ahead Market Optimization</span>
      <span class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm border border-indigo-500/30 bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-300">Renewable Integration</span>
      <span class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm border border-indigo-500/30 bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-300">EU EED Compliance</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
